				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$ \raisebox{1ex}{$a$}\!\left/ \!\raisebox{-1ex}{$k$}\right. $$\end{document}ak) was applied to control error inflation. For instance, αcorr for the null-hypotheses families regarding the primary outcome INR was set to αcorr = 0.00357 (k = 14).
